{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 151619, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 101286, "uid": 108034, "type": 4, "title": "（已更新）利用低级人偶（白色普通/绿色罕见）提高RD/RB伤害", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1646713001, "updated_at": 1646979451, "updated_uid": 108034, "comment_at": 1675171585, "last_at": 1675665155, "comment_count": 28, "status": 1, "summary": "众所周知，天命之子是采用RD/WB/翻牌的活动循环进行的。其中RD活动是5星天子的主要获取来源，在能斩车的情况下，每期能获得超过100个五星天子，也是最建议刚入坑的新手玩家投入资源的地方。目前RD/R", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/311517.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/584778.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/128607.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 36, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 42696, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 41, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 151619, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">众所周知，天命之子是采用RD/WB/翻牌的活动循环进行的。其中RD活动是5星天子的主要获取来源，在能斩车的情况下，每期能获得超过100个五星天子，也是最建议刚入坑的新手玩家投入资源的地方。</span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\">目前RD/RB的主要增伤手段包括</div><div style=\"\">1.提高天子加值 2.点火 3.装备附魔 4.温泉等级 <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">5.人偶系统</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><br><div><span style=\"\">其中人偶系统刚出不久，目前高级人偶（橙色传说/紫色史诗/蓝色稀有）获取难度较大，且提升<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">加值非常困难。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">但是低级人偶<span style=\"\">（白色普通/绿色罕见）通过太空漫步及星云副本即可大量获得，提升人偶<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">加值也非常方便，非常利于我们利用<span style=\"\">低级人偶<span style=\"\">提高RD/RB伤害。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></span></div><div>由于部分人偶BUFF会与天子技能一致，无法叠加，会被覆盖<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">失效</span>。因此我列出了目前主流RD队中的天子<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/91286.html\">（感谢鲨鱼布丁大大的攻略，可点击此处跳转）</a>，及其<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">增伤</span>BUFF的名称，方便筛选所用人偶。</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">注意！</span>由于技能效果覆盖机制，部分带了玩偶的天子在WB中可能会起到反效果。建议</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1.将玩偶带在只用在RD，不用在WB的天子上（比如RD刀）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2.在WB前卸下人偶。<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">低级</span>人偶卸下消耗不大（<span style=\"\">白色普通人偶需100人偶洗涤剂，<span style=\"\">绿色罕见人偶需200人偶洗涤剂，人偶洗涤剂可以通过分解人偶获得</span></span>）</span></span></div><div><br></div></div></span><div style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div></div></span><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">火队</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">目前主流火队配置为</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">新火刀火狐狸+鹰眼+德蕾莎+火相机+火弓</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">以下是各天子增伤BUFF的名称和效果（此处只列增伤BUFF，不考虑刷条）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/311517.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/311517.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">理论上，只要图中天子没有提供的增伤BUFF，那么我们都可以通过附加人偶来提供，从而实现增伤！</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">以下为<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">能提供增伤BUFF的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">火系</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">低级人偶<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">（白色普通/绿色罕见）</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/584778.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/584778.png\"></div>以上数值均为1级人偶效果（别问，问就是我也没加满）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">最大化增伤效果为</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">火狐狸队长（兜帽兔/火发带）、德蕾莎（火拳）、火弓/鹰眼/火相机（小宝箱）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">其中<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">火拳</span>增伤效果最大</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">木队</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">目前主流木队配置为<div><br><div>尤娜+欧若拉+滑板+萨拉苏+白猫</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">以下是各天子增伤BUFF的名称和效果（此处只列增伤BUFF，不考虑刷条）</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/128607.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/128607.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">理论上，只要图中天子没有提供的增伤BUFF，那么我们都可以通过附加人偶来提供，从而实现增伤！</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">以下为<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">能提供增伤BUFF的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">木系</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">低级人偶<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">（白色普通/绿色罕见）</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/63412.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/63412.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">以上数值均为1级人偶效果（木气球满级数值为150%）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">最大化增伤效果为</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">尤娜/滑板队长（木基佬）、尤娜/滑板（木气球）、尤娜（草精灵）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">木气球</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">伤害提升明显，要给最后一个DS带</span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">草精灵和木气球带一个就可以了，木气球很容易满级，拆卸方便，所以推荐木气球。木基佬的队长BUFF属于是锦上添花</span></span></span></div><br></span></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">水队</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">目前主流木队配置为</span><div><br><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">水罗刹+青钢影+阿罗汉+伪娘+萨拉苏</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">以下是各天子增伤BUFF/刷条BUFF的名称和效果（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">由于只有水系低级人偶中有刷条BUFF，所以我只在该系中列出刷条</span>）</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/611763.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/611763.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">理论上，只要图中天子没有提供的增伤BUFF<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">/刷条BUFF</span>，那么我们都可以通过附加人偶来提供，从而实现增伤！</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">以下为<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">能提供增伤BUFF<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">/刷条BUFF</span>的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">水系</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">低级人偶<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">（白色普通/绿色罕见）</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/613852.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/613852.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">以上数值均为1级人偶效果</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">最大化增伤效果为</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">青钢影/伪娘/阿罗汉（水丽莎/丸子头）、水罗刹/<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">青钢影/<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">阿罗汉(水喇叭/水滴)</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">由于上述人偶除了水丽莎，其他三个人偶都是刷条BUFF，对伤害提升效果未知。且除水罗刹外，其他天子基本都是WB必上</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div></span></span></div>建议先只佩戴<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">水丽莎</span>即可，其他人偶等火RAID我实测一下效果</div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">暗队</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">目前主流暗队配置为</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">棒球妹+暗伊芙+暗月月+乳贴+对魔忍</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">以下是各天子增伤BUFF的名称和效果（此处只列增伤BUFF，不考虑刷条）</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/893961.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/893961.png\"></div><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">暗系低级人偶没有能增加RAID伤害的，不过如果你获得了高级人偶，还是可以对照此表看是否在RD中佩戴</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">光队</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">光系低级人偶也没有能增加RAID伤害的</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">等暗RD开了，更新光系阵容BUFF</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2022.3.11 暂更到此</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">后续还会追更低级人偶满级后BUFF数值，有已经满级的朋友也欢迎留言，我会加在表里~</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">等火/水/木 RD开了以后，还会更新在各系RD中的实测效果~</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">祝各位都能1FT斩车，轻松通关RB30层~</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">这也是本人第一次做攻略，探讨为主，有不足之处欢迎指出~</span></span></span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">To be continued...</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/311517.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/8/584778.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/108034/2022/2/11/128607.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 108034, "username": "念", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/16.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 26, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 99128361, "content_num": 4, "read_num": 210061, "like_num": 122}, "update_user": {"uid": 108034, "username": "念", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/16.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 26, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 108034, "username": "念", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/16.png", "last_i